  <item>
    <title>01.这真是一期令人生气的主题！！！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6630706948581314506e11cb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6630706948581314506e11cb</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Apr 2024 04:15:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在本期节目中，我们将探讨那些让我们心甘情愿掏空钱包的爱好。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从盲盒的惊喜到精致的杯子，再到收藏价值连城的漫画书，每一种爱好都带来了独特的乐趣和挑战。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们将分享那些令人无法抗拒的“烧钱坑”，来聊聊它们背后的文化意义和个人情感。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴嗖嗖嗖🚀】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">01:16</a> 手办、潮玩、盲盒，不知不觉的氪金大户</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a> 什么？玩儿乐高得换套房？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">06:48</a> 杯子杯子杯子！只有一张嘴的我却有好几十个杯子！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="633">10:33</a> 我很好奇树也是怎么理解所谓『入坑』的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="725">12:05</a> 女生恐怕都逃不过的魔咒坑——口红</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1158">19:18</a> 你曾经为了画买过单吗？我和树也都有！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1315">21:55</a> 树也在二次元动漫的大坑里无法自拔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1487">24:47</a> 纸质书超级大的执念，如此沉迷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1722">28:42</a> 真不是我迷信，只怪水晶太美丽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1894">31:34</a> 那些年入坑的时候你到底是咋想的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 摄影、唱片、骑行、户外，还有哪些坑搞垮了你的钱包？</span></p><span></span><p><span>每项爱好都带来了特别的喜悦和挑战，而了解这些“烧钱坑”可以帮助我们更加明智地选择投入。不管你热爱什么，最重要的是享受其中的乐趣并找到自己的热情所在。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhDSz2WTEtNRnv7_ZsVB01ZZC3di.m4a" length="44660985" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk2wMjJphAJ_fwOXJQy0AmLrbjSR.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>1</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>你浪费了多少时间在生活这件事上？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/661ca8e948c40e2fb05c5027</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">661ca8e948c40e2fb05c5027</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 15 Apr 2024 04:11:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，在这一集中，我们探讨了生活中那些看似“浪费时间”的时刻，实际上却给我们带来了无穷的快乐和满足感。有时候，正是这些简单的活动丰富了我们的生活体验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴嗖嗖嗖🚀】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a> &nbsp;没想到一条朋友圈引发这么多共鸣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">01:09</a> &nbsp;在北京赏花赏落叶，疯狂十连拍的都是谁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">04:45</a> &nbsp;树也迷上看vlog</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="406">06:46</a> &nbsp;在公交车上，谁还不是人间观察者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a> &nbsp;什么？发呆是在保养脑子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="792">13:12</a> &nbsp;一天干了很多事，一天什么都没做</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="886">14:46</a> &nbsp;我们是否是热爱生活的人呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后，祝大家或热烈，或平静的好好生活呀！</span></p><span></span><p><span>记得留言给我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>&lt; 你们都在哪些自己觉得值得的事情上"浪费"着时间？&gt;</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们下期见~</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>morning flip</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>仆はもう出ていくよ</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lg4XfRm0_qaDlDHmJw51Mhx2UvML.m4a" length="27183726" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:18:44</itunes:duration>
